~ start

match some_gamestate_value
	when 0
		=> heater_convo_1
	when 1
		=> heater_convo_2
	when 2
		=> heater_convo_3
	else
		Error:This dialogue should never play. Heater Number is not 0 1 or 2
=> END

#Should be used for all 3 convos where heaters are turned on, 
#using conditionals to branch between them

~ heater_convo_1
Wizard: Wh-What has't thou done?!
Fenn: I turned on one of the heaters
Wizard: WHAT? NAY! STOP THAT. STOP THAT RIGHT NOW!
Fenn: Did it do anything, Az?
Az: cough Uh. Yeah, it's definitely a bit warmer in here.
Wizard: Grrrrrrr. Thou shalt pay for this. Just thee wait.
Wizard: I'm going backeth to my workshop!
Az: Excuse you? YOUR workshop?!
Wizard: Ahem. Perhaps I mispoke. Um... gotta go!
Winston leaves
Az: Ugh!
=> END

~ heater_convo_2
Wizard: AGAIN?!
Fenn: Hey Az! I got another one!
Az: Haha! Sucks to be you, wizard boy!
Wizard: STOP! HALT THINE HORSES!! IT'S NOT FINISHED YET!
Az: Oh yeah, the ice around the door is definitely melting.
Wizard: NAY! Prithee! Stop!
Az: Oh yeah? Come out and stop us yourself.
Wizard:...
Winston leaves
Az: That's what I thought.
=> END

~ heater_convo_3
Winston: NO WAITETH!
Az: Oh come on.
Fenn: What's wrong?
Az: That's the last heater, and the ice didn't melt all the way.
Winston: Waiteth- wha- Aha! Of course!
Winston: That was the planneth all 'long! Yes. Yes! Go ahead, waste thy timeth!
Az: Ignore him, Fenn. It wasn't a waste. Come on back, we'll figure something out.
=> END